      <title>Kate Bush and Grace Jones urge Australian government not to legalise AI ‘theft’</title>
      <link>https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/nov/24/kate-bush-grace-jones-australian-artists-copyright-law-ai</link>
      <description>Singers among 7,000 artists and creatives urging Labor to protect copyright law in face of lobbying from AI companies Get our breaking news email , free app or daily news podcast Kate Bush, Grace Jones and Sir Ian Rankin have joined 7,000 artists and creatives around the world pleading for the Australian government not to weaken copyright law, urging Labor not to “not legalise the theft of the work of the world’s creators on their soil”. The international push, the latest in a global pushback…</description>
